@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
-From 42b75d9ede264f3efccb98745b01db847778654d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From ff38371c0fef4f3c76a34ec995911923b1a7d736 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
 From: David Bauer <mail@david-bauer.net>
 Date: Mon, 3 Nov 2025 18:47:27 +0100
